Task: Fix TorrentManager restart re-download bug

Summary: WebTorrent was re-downloading completed torrents after server restart
because the DB stored the torrent subfolder path (completeDir/name) as the
WebTorrent 'path' option. On restart, WebTorrent appended the torrent name
again (completeDir/name/name/) and found no files, starting a fresh download.

Fix: Store completeDownloadPath (the parent directory) in both the WebTorrent
object and the DB path field. The torrent:completed event still emits targetDir
so ImportManager receives the actual torrent folder path for import.

Files changed:
- server/src/services/TorrentManager.ts: lines 546, 551
